title: "SHOT: The Supporting Hyperplane Optimization Toolkit"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
url: "https://shotsolver.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/coin-or/SHOT"
license: EPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  SHOT is an open-source solver for mixed-integer nonlinear programming
  (MINLP), written in C++. It is global for convex MINLP, and mainly a
  heuristic for nonconvex MINLP, where the bounds on the objective value
  are still guaranteed.
keywords:
  - mixed-integer nonlinear programming
  - MINLP
  - outer approximation
  - extended supporting hyperplane
  - optimization solver
